# EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

## Project Planning

Project planning defines **how EduGenie will be developed, who will perform each activity, when it will be completed, what resources are required, and how project risks will be controlled**.

The plan below is suitable for a **college mini-project, final-year project, or software-development project report**.

---

# 1. Project Planning Overview

### Project Name

**EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant**

### Project Type

AI-powered educational software application

### Development Approach

**Agile / Iterative Development**

### Estimated Duration

**12 weeks**

### Primary Technology

**Google Gemini API**

### Proposed Stack

| Layer           | Technology                                        |
| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Frontend        | React.js / HTML / CSS / JavaScript                |
| Backend         | Node.js + Express                                 |
| AI              | Google Gemini API                                 |
| Database        | Firebase Firestore / PostgreSQL                   |
| Authentication  | Firebase Authentication                           |
| Version Control | Git + GitHub                                      |
| Deployment      | Firebase / Google Cloud / suitable cloud platform |

---

# 2. Project Objectives

The project aims to:

1. Develop an AI-powered learning assistant.
2. Integrate Google Gemini into an educational application.
3. Provide interactive question answering.
4. Generate personalized explanations.
5. Generate quizzes and practice questions.
6. Provide study-plan assistance.
7. Track relevant learning progress.
8. Provide personalized learning recommendations.
9. Create an easy-to-use student interface.
10. Develop a secure and scalable foundation for future educational features.

---

