# 4. Development Methodology

An **Agile methodology** is appropriate because AI-based applications often require experimentation and refinement.

Instead of developing everything at once:

```text id="q4wq9f"
Plan
  ↓
Design
  ↓
Develop
  ↓
Test
  ↓
Review
  ↓
Improve
  ↓
Next Iteration
```

This allows the team to test Gemini responses and user experience early.

