# 18. AI Response Evaluation

Because EduGenie depends on generative AI, AI responses should be evaluated separately from normal software testing.

Possible evaluation criteria:

| Criterion             | Question                                     |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| Relevance             | Does the response answer the question?       |
| Clarity               | Is it understandable?                        |
| Educational value     | Does it help learning?                       |
| Consistency           | Does similar input produce useful responses? |
| Accuracy              | Is the content factually appropriate?        |
| Level appropriateness | Is it suitable for the selected level?       |
| Safety                | Does it avoid inappropriate output?          |

