# 24. Risk Management

| Risk                      | Impact | Mitigation                                                     |
| ------------------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Gemini API failure        | High   | Error handling + fallback messages                             |
| API quota/usage limits    | High   | Usage controls and efficient prompts                           |
| AI-generated inaccuracies | High   | Validation, clear uncertainty handling, educational safeguards |
| Data privacy issue        | High   | Minimal data collection + access control                       |
| Development delays        | Medium | Prioritize MVP                                                 |
| Database failure          | High   | Backups and appropriate cloud configuration                    |
| Poor UI usability         | Medium | Early prototype testing                                        |
| Integration problems      | Medium | API testing before full integration                            |
| Internet dependency       | Medium | Clear offline/unavailable-state messaging                      |
| Scope expansion           | High   | Freeze MVP requirements                                        |

