# 28. Project Success Criteria

EduGenie can be considered successful when:

1. Users can register and authenticate.
2. Students can ask educational questions.
3. Gemini can provide relevant explanations.
4. Students can generate quizzes.
5. Quiz results can be calculated.
6. Students can create study plans.
7. Learning activity can be recorded.
8. Basic recommendations can be generated.
9. The application protects user information.
10. The system can recover gracefully from AI/API failures.
11. The complete application can be demonstrated end-to-end.

