## Project Planning Conclusion

**EduGenie's development should follow an iterative 12-week plan, beginning with requirements and design and progressing through backend, frontend, Gemini integration, testing, and deployment. The project should prioritize a manageable MVP—AI Tutor, Gemini integration, quizzes, study planning, and basic progress tracking—before adding advanced features.**

